flowchart LR
  Source[CSV or JSON level] --> Parse[Parse format and metadata]
  Parse --> Canonical[Canonicalize content]
  Canonical --> Hash[Calculate trusted XXH128 identity]
  Parse --> Legacy[Calculate compatibility hash]
  Parse --> Eligibility[Check level score eligibility]
  Eligibility -->|eligible| Points[Calculate level and player points]
  Eligibility -->|ineligible| Excluded[Exclude from score]
  Hash --> Shared[Shared identity for persistence and clients]
